WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.994
Now look down through the ground,
toward the Sun.

00:00:03.443 --> 00:00:06.706
It is 23.4° below the horizon.

00:00:07.156 --> 00:00:12.031
Since mid-November it has been more
than 18° down, too deep even for

00:00:12.031 --> 00:00:15.759
twilight, and it stays that deep
until late January.

00:00:16.209 --> 00:00:18.542
The Moon is down there too, close to
the Sun.

00:00:18.992 --> 00:00:22.673
So for weeks on end, the stars have
the sky to themselves.
